WEBVTT

00:01:28.144 --> 00:01:30.293
and it's really changed
how a lot of people --

00:01:30.317 --> 00:01:34.473
they're just open to the creative genius
coming from the outside.

00:01:34.497 --> 00:01:38.355
So it's a delight to welcome
to the TED Connects stage

00:01:38.379 --> 00:01:39.592
Elizabeth Gilbert.

00:01:43.399 --> 00:01:44.908
Elizabeth Gilbert: Hey, Chris.

00:01:44.932 --> 00:01:47.403
CA: Great to see you.

00:01:47.427 --> 00:01:51.484
How are you? Where are you?
Who are you living with or staying with?

00:01:51.508 --> 00:01:52.696
What's up?

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:54.286
EG: I'm fine.

00:01:54.310 --> 00:01:57.983
I don't want to brag,
but I'm in New Jersey,

00:01:58.007 --> 00:02:00.044
where anybody would want to be.